{
  "note": "Timings correspond to public/audio/windshield-frit-dots.wav (NOT the raw file).",
  "source": "C:\\Users\\ducnq\\Downloads\\Video/episodes/windshield-frit-dots/subtitles-raw.json remapped through C:\\Users\\ducnq\\Downloads\\Video/public/audio/windshield-frit-dots.timemap.json",
  "audio": "public/audio/windshield-frit-dots.wav",
  "duration": 23.892,
  "tempo": 1.12,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Look along the top edge of a windshield",
      "start": 0.106,
      "end": 1.679
    },
    {
      "text": "and you'll find a black border that breaks",
      "start": 1.882,
      "end": 3.311
    },
    {
      "text": "into a scatter of dots before it fades out.",
      "start": 3.346,
      "end": 5.276
    },
    {
      "text": "That border is ceramic paint baked into the",
      "start": 5.542,
      "end": 7.471
    },
    {
      "text": "glass,",
      "start": 7.525,
      "end": 8.061
    },
    {
      "text": "and it is covering the adhesive that holds",
      "start": 8.258,
      "end": 9.991
    },
    {
      "text": "the windshield onto the car.",
      "start": 10.026,
      "end": 11.259
    },
    {
      "text": "Sunlight would slowly cook that glue,",
      "start": 11.62,
      "end": 13.139
    },
    {
      "text": "so the black band shields it.",
      "start": 13.462,
      "end": 14.622
    },
    {
      "text": "The dots are the clever part.",
      "start": 14.857,
      "end": 15.964
    },
    {
      "text": "Black glass heats faster than clear glass,",
      "start": 16.235,
      "end": 18.254
    },
    {
      "text": "and a hard edge between the two would build",
      "start": 18.44,
      "end": 19.995
    },
    {
      "text": "enough stress to crack the pane,",
      "start": 20.084,
      "end": 21.353
    },
    {
      "text": "so the dots spread that change out gradually.",
      "start": 21.581,
      "end": 23.654
    }
  ],
